**MINOR** — The plan is structurally sound and follows the template faithfully. Retrieval is above-threshold. However, one unresolved internal contradiction (bashrc path) would propagate into both deliverables if not locked before implementation, and the validator-vs-runner division of labor is vague enough to invite scope drift. Fixable without restructuring.

